6 7h3zm7 0l3 18h-3l-3-18h3zm7 0v18h-3V7h3z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#integraciones\" aria-label=\"Slack\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M9 19a2.5 2.5 0 11-2.5-2.5H9V19z\" fill=\"#E01E5A\"></path><path d=\"M10.3 19a2.5 2.5 0 115 0v6.3a2.5 2.5 0 11-5 0V19z\" fill=\"#E01E5A\"></path><path d=\"M12.8 9a2.5 2.5 0 11-2.5-2.5V9h2.5z\" fill=\"#36C5F0\"></path><path d=\"M12.8 10.3a2.5 2.5 0 110 5H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 110-5h6.3z\" fill=\"#36C5F0\"></path><path d=\"M22.8 12.8a2.5 2.5 0 112.5 2.5h-2.5v-2.5z\" fill=\"#2EB67D\"></path><path d=\"M21.5 12.8a2.5 2.5 0 11-5 0V6.5a2.5 2.5 0 115 0v6.3z\" fill=\"#2EB67D\"></path><path d=\"M19 22.8a2.5 2.5 0 112.5 2.5V22.8H19z\" fill=\"#ECB22E\"></path><path d=\"M19 21.5a2.5 2.5 0 110-5h6.3a2.5 2.5 0 110 5H19z\" fill=\"#ECB22E\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#integraciones\" aria-label=\"Stripe\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M14.8 12.7c0-.9.7-1.2 1.8-1.2 1.7 0 3.8.5 5.5 1.4V8c-1.8-.7-3.7-1-5.5-1-4.5 0-7.5 2.4-7.5 6.3 0 6.2 8.5 5.2 8.5 7.9 0 1-.9 1.4-2.1 1.4-1.9 0-4.4-.8-6.3-1.9v4.9c2.1.9 4.2 1.3 6.3 1.3 4.6 0 7.7-2.3 7.7-6.2 0-6.7-8.4-5.5-8.4-8z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"marquee\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"marquee-track\"><span class=\"marquee-item\">Automatización de Leads</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">CRM Inteligente</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Captación 24/7</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Calificación Automática</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Seguimiento con AI</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Conversión Optimizada</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Marketing Digital</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Integración Total</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Automatización de Leads</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">CRM Inteligente</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Captación 24/7</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Calificación Automática</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Seguimiento con AI</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Conversión Optimizada</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Marketing Digital</span><span class=\"marquee-item\">Integración Total</span></div></div><section id=\"problema\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><span class=\"section-tag\">El Desafío</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">¿Por qué pierdes <span>ventas hoy?</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\">El mercado se mueve más rápido que tu equipo humano. Aquí es donde se rompe el proceso.</p></div><div class=\"problem-grid reveal\"><article class=\"problem-card glow-card\"><div class=\"prob-head\"><div class=\"prob-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div><div class=\"prob-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div></div><h3>Seguimiento Tardío</h3><p>El 78% de los leads se enfría en los primeros 5 minutos. Si no respondes ya, la competencia lo hará.</p></article><article class=\"problem-card glow-card\"><div class=\"prob-head\"><div class=\"prob-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div><div class=\"prob-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"></polyline></svg></div></div><h3>Ruido de Prospectos</h3><p>Tu equipo pierde el 60% de su tiempo con personas que no están listas para comprar. Calificamos por ti.</p></article><article class=\"problem-card glow-card\"><div class=\"prob-head\"><div class=\"prob-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div><div class=\"prob-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 1 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z\"></path></svg></div></div><h3>Fricción Manual</h3><p>Capturar datos y enviar correos manualmente mata la productividad. La IA lo hace en milisegundos.</p></article><article class=\"problem-card glow-card\"><div class=\"prob-head\"><div class=\"prob-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</div><div class=\"prob-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div></div><h3>Puntos Ciegos</h3><p>Sin datos claros del embudo, estás adivinando. Nuestra IA te da visibilidad total del ROI.</p></article></div></div></section><section id=\"soluciones\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><span class=\"section-tag\">Soluciones</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">Ingeniería de <span>Ventas AI</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\">Combinamos software de alto nivel con estrategias de conversión probadas en cientos de campañas reales.</p></div><div class=\"bento reveal\"><div class=\"bento-card bento-feature glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v4\"></path><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></div><h3>Agentes de Ventas AI · Núcleo del Sistema</h3><p>Bots que no solo responden. Califican intención, recolectan datos clave y agendan citas reales en tu calendario. Operan 24/7 con la voz de tu marca.</p><div class=\"feature-visual\"><div class=\"feature-visual-head\"><span>ACTIVIDAD · HOY</span><span class=\"live-dot\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>EN VIVO</span></div><div class=\"feature-stats\"><div class=\"feature-stat\"><div class=\"feature-stat-val\">247</div><div class=\"feature-stat-label\">Conversaciones</div></div><div class=\"feature-stat\"><div class=\"feature-stat-val\">182</div><div class=\"feature-stat-label\">Calificados</div></div><div class=\"feature-stat\"><div class=\"feature-stat-val\">24</div><div class=\"feature-stat-label\">Citas agendadas</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-tall glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Captación Multicanal</h3><p>Conectamos Meta, Google, WhatsApp, formularios web y APIs en un único flujo. Cada lead entra en segundos.</p><div class=\"terminal\"><div class=\"terminal-head\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"terminal-body\"><div class=\"terminal-line\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span> lead.capture --source=meta</div><div class=\"terminal-line\"><span class=\"ok\">✓</span> lead recibido · 0.4s</div><div class=\"terminal-line\"><span class=\"ok\">✓</span> calificado · score 91</div><div class=\"terminal-line\"><span class=\"ok\">✓</span> cita agendada</div></div></div></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-wide glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg></div><h3>CRM Inteligente</h3><p>Prioriza prospectos calientes y secuencia el seguimiento por WhatsApp y Email automáticamente.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-wide glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polyline></svg></div><h3>Nurturing Adaptativo</h3><p>Secuencias que mutan según el comportamiento del usuario para maximizar el cierre.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-wide glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></div><h3>Dashboards Real-Time</h3><p>Control total del embudo, conversiones y ROAS publicitario en tiempo real.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-small glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3>Paid Media Optimizado</h3><p>Campañas en Meta y Google Ads alimentadas por datos de conversión reales.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-small glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Datos Protegidos</h3><p>Infraestructura cifrada y cumplimiento de privacidad de extremo a extremo.</p></div><div class=\"bento-card bento-small glow-card\"><div class=\"bento-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Soporte Dedicado</h3><p>Equipo humano detrás de la IA, disponible cuando tu negocio lo necesita.</p></div></div></div></section><aside class=\"stats\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"stats-grid reveal\"><div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-val\" data-count=\"3\" data-suffix=\"×\">0×</div><div class=\"stat-label\">Más leads calificados</div></div><div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-val\" data-count=\"1\" data-suffix=\"min\">0min</div><div class=\"stat-label\">Respuesta garantizada</div></div><div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-val\" data-count=\"40\" data-suffix=\"%\">0%</div><div class=\"stat-label\">Aumento en conversiones</div></div><div class=\"stat-card\"><div class=\"stat-val\" data-count=\"24\" data-suffix=\"/7\">0/7</div><div class=\"stat-label\">Atención sin pausa</div></div></div></div></aside><section id=\"proceso\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><span class=\"section-tag\">El Proceso</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">De lead a cliente en <span>piloto automático</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\">Tres pasos. Cero fricción. Resultados desde el día uno.</p></div><div class=\"process-flow reveal\"><div class=\"flow-node\"><div class=\"flow-num\">PASO 01</div><div class=\"flow-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"></polyline></svg></div><h4>Captación Multicanal</h4><p>Unificamos todas tus fuentes de leads en una sola neurona digital.</p></div><div class=\"flow-connector\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"12\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"></line><polyline points=\"44 6 50 12 44 18\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"flow-node\"><div class=\"flow-num\">PASO 02</div><div class=\"flow-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 1-.34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 9.5 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M14.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 0 .34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 14.5 2Z\"></path></svg></div><h4>Calificación AI</h4><p>La IA evalúa interés y capacidad de compra al instante.</p></div><div class=\"flow-connector\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"12\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"></line><polyline points=\"44 6 50 12 44 18\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"flow-node\"><div class=\"flow-num\">PASO 03</div><div class=\"flow-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"></line><polyline points=\"9 16 11 18 15 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h4>Cierre de Citas</h4><p>Agendamos prospectos listos en tu calendario sin que muevas un dedo.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"casos-exito\" style=\"position:relative\"><div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"opacity:0.5\"></div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><span class=\"section-tag\">Prueba Social</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">Resultados <span>Comprobados</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\">Empresas que ya transformaron su proceso de ventas con nuestra IA.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-3 reveal\"><article class=\"testimonial-card glow-card\"><div class=\"quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&quot;</div><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 estrellas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg></div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">Antes perdíamos docenas de leads los fines de semana. Desde que implementamos AI Lead Shield, nuestra tasa de respuesta bajó a segundos y las conversiones aumentaron un 45% en el primer mes.</p><div class=\"testimonial-author\"><div class=\"testimonial-avatar\">JC</div><div><h4 class=\"testimonial-name\">Juan Carlos M.</h4><div class=\"testimonial-role\">Director Comercial · Inmobiliaria</div></div><div class=\"testimonial-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>VERIFICADO</div></div></article><article class=\"testimonial-card glow-card\"><div class=\"quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&quot;</div><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 estrellas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg></div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">El CRM inteligente y la calificación automática nos ahorran más de 20 horas semanales. Ahora mi equipo solo habla con prospectos calificados y listos para comprar.</p><div class=\"testimonial-author\"><div class=\"testimonial-avatar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #00FF9D, #00F2FF)\">AL</div><div><h4 class=\"testimonial-name\">Ana Laura T.</h4><div class=\"testimonial-role\">CEO · Servicios B2B</div></div><div class=\"testimonial-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>VERIFICADO</div></div></article><article class=\"testimonial-card glow-card\"><div class=\"quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&quot;</div><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 estrellas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2\"></polygon></svg></div><p class=\"testimonial-text\">Pasamos de responder leads a las dos horas a hacerlo en segundos. El ROI fue evidente en la tercera semana. Nuestro ROAS subió un 62% sin tocar el presupuesto.</p><div class=\"testimonial-author\"><div class=\"testimonial-avatar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #00F2FF, #ffffff)\">RV</div><div><h4 class=\"testimonial-name\">Roberto Vargas</h4><div class=\"testimonial-role\">Founder · Agencia Digital</div></div><div class=\"testimonial-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>VERIFICADO</div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"integraciones\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><span class=\"section-tag\">Integraciones</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">Todo lo que ya usas, <span>en un solo flujo</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\">No necesitas cambiar de software. Enlazamos Meta, Google, WhatsApp, formularios y tu CRM para que cada lead entre en segundos, quede registrado y siga el camino correcto —sin copiar datos ni perder conversaciones entre aplicaciones.</p></div><div class=\"integrations-grid reveal\"><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Meta Ads\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M16 4C9.4 4 4 9.4 4 16s5.4 12 12 12 12-5.4 12-12S22.6 4 16 4zm3.4 14.5l-.5 3h-2.4v8.4c-.2 0-.4.1-.5.1-6.1 0-11-4.9-11-11s4.9-11 11-11 11 4.9 11 11c0 5.5-4.1 10.1-9.4 10.9V21.5h2.5l.5-3h-3v-2c0-.8.4-1.6 1.7-1.6h1.4v-2.6s-1.3-.2-2.5-.2c-2.6 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.4h-2.8v3h2.8v7.4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Google Ads\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M14 4l-9.5 16.5L8 26h6.5l9.5-16.5L20.5 4H14zm9 24l3 5h6.5l3-5.5L29 13l-3.5 6.5L23 28z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"WhatsApp Business\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M16 3C8.8 3 3 8.8 3 16c0 2.3.6 4.5 1.7 6.4L3 29l6.8-1.7c1.8 1 3.9 1.6 6.2 1.6 7.2 0 13-5.8 13-13S23.2 3 16 3zm0 23.6c-2 0-3.9-.5-5.5-1.5l-.4-.2-4 1 1.1-3.9-.3-.4c-1.1-1.7-1.6-3.7-1.6-5.6 0-5.9 4.8-10.7 10.7-10.7s10.7 4.8 10.7 10.7-4.9 10.6-10.7 10.6zm5.9-8c-.3-.2-1.9-.9-2.2-1-.3-.1-.5-.2-.7.2s-.8 1-1 1.2c-.2.2-.4.2-.7.1-.3-.2-1.4-.5-2.6-1.6-1-.9-1.6-1.9-1.8-2.3-.2-.3 0-.5.1-.7.1-.1.3-.4.5-.5.2-.2.2-.3.3-.5.1-.2.1-.4 0-.5-.1-.2-.7-1.6-.9-2.2-.2-.6-.5-.5-.7-.5h-.6c-.2 0-.5.1-.8.4s-1.1 1-1.1 2.5 1.1 2.9 1.3 3.1c.2.2 2.2 3.3 5.3 4.7.7.3 1.3.5 1.8.6.7.2 1.4.2 2 .1.6-.1 1.9-.8 2.2-1.5.3-.7.3-1.4.2-1.5-.1-.1-.4-.2-.6-.3z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"HubSpot\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M22.5 11.4V8.5a2 2 0 1 0-2 0v2.9a8 8 0 0 0-3.8 1.4l-7.4-5.6a2.3 2.3 0 1 0-1.5 1.5l7.4 5.7a8 8 0 0 0 .1 9l-2.3 2.3a2 2 0 1 0 1.4 1.4l2.3-2.3a8 8 0 1 0 5.8-14.4zm-1 12a4.2 4.2 0 1 1 4.2-4.2 4.2 4.2 0 0 1-4.2 4.2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Make\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M9 7l3 18h-3L6 7h3zm7 0l3 18h-3l-3-18h3zm7 0v18h-3V7h3z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Zapier\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M16 4l3 6 6 3-6 3-3 6-3-6-6-3 6-3 3-6z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Slack\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><rect x=\"11\" y=\"3\" width=\"4\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"17\" y=\"15\" width=\"4\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"15\" y=\"17\" width=\"14\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Calendly\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"6\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"3\"></rect><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"9\"></line><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"9\"></line><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"27\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Stripe\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M14.8 12.7c0-.9.7-1.2 1.8-1.2 1.7 0 3.8.5 5.5 1.4V8c-1.8-.7-3.7-1-5.5-1-4.5 0-7.5 2.4-7.5 6.3 0 6.2 8.5 5.2 8.5 7.9 0 1-.9 1.4-2.1 1.4-1.9 0-4.4-.8-6.3-1.9v4.9c2.1.9 4.2 1.3 6.3 1.3 4.6 0 7.7-2.3 7.7-6.2 0-6.7-8.4-5.5-8.4-8z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Notion\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M6 6h6l8 12V6h6v20h-6L12 14v12H6V6z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Gmail\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"26\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"></rect><polyline points=\"3 8 16 18 29 8\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"integration-tile\" title=\"Salesforce\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M11 8a5 5 0 0 1 9 2 4 4 0 0 1 5 5 4 4 0 0 1-2 7 5 5 0 0 1-9-2 4 4 0 0 1-5-4 4 4 0 0 1 2-8z\"></path></svg></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header reveal\"><span class=\"section-tag\">Preguntas Frecuentes</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">Todo lo que necesitas <span>saber</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\">Si no encuentras tu respuesta, agenda una llamada y resolvemos cualquier duda en persona.</p></div><div class=\"faq-list reveal\"><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>¿Cuánto tiempo toma implementar el sistema?<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Implementación completa en menos de 30 días. Esto incluye integración con tus canales actuales (Meta, Google, WhatsApp), entrenamiento del modelo con la voz de tu marca, configuración del CRM y pruebas de calidad antes de salir en vivo.</div></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>¿Necesito conocimiento técnico para usarlo?<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-content\">No. Nosotros configuramos todo, te entregamos un dashboard simple y un onboarding personalizado. Tu equipo solo ve leads ya calificados y citas agendadas — el resto lo maneja la IA en segundo plano.</div></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>¿Qué tan rápido responde la IA a un lead nuevo?<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Menos de 1 minuto garantizado, y normalmente respondemos en segundos. Estudios muestran que responder en los primeros 5 minutos aumenta la conversión hasta 9× vs. responder a la hora — nosotros bajamos ese tiempo a segundos.</div></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>¿Mi industria es compatible con esta tecnología?<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Trabajamos con inmobiliarias, clínicas, escuelas, agencias, e-commerce, servicios B2B y más. Si tu negocio depende de captar y cerrar leads, AI Lead Shield se adapta a tu flujo. Agenda una llamada y validamos tu caso en 15 minutos.</div></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>¿Cómo se calcula el ROI del sistema?<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Medimos tres variables: tiempo de respuesta, tasa de conversión de lead a cita, y tasa de cierre. Nuestros clientes recuperan la inversión típicamente entre los primeros 30 y 60 días, gracias al aumento promedio de 3× en leads calificados.</div></details><details class=\"faq-item\"><summary>¿Mis datos están seguros?<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Sí. Toda la infraestructura está cifrada extremo a extremo y cumplimos con las normativas de privacidad relevantes. Tus datos nunca se usan para entrenar modelos públicos, y puedes exportar o eliminar todo en cualquier momento.</div></details></div></div></section><section id=\"nosotros\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"about-grid reveal\"><div class=\"about-visual\"><div class=\"sys-label\">Fuentes de leads</div><div class=\"sys-row\"><div class=\"sys-node\" title=\"Meta Ads\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M16 4C9.4 4 4 9.4 4 16s5.4 12 12 12 12-5.4 12-12S22.6 4 16 4zm3.4 14.5l-.5 3h-2.4v8.4c-.2 0-.4.1-.5.1-6.1 0-11-4.9-11-11s4.9-11 11-11 11 4.9 11 11c0 5.5-4.1 10.1-9.4 10.9V21.5h2.5l.5-3h-3v-2c0-.8.4-1.6 1.7-1.6h1.4v-2.6s-1.3-.2-2.5-.2c-2.6 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.4h-2.8v3h2.8v7.4\"></path></svg>META</div><div class=\"sys-node\" title=\"Google Ads\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M14 4l-9.5 16.5L8 26h6.5l9.5-16.5L20.5 4H14zm9 24l3 5h6.5l3-5.5L29 13l-3.5 6.5L23 28z\"></path></svg>GOOGLE</div><div class=\"sys-node\" title=\"WhatsApp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M16 3C8.8 3 3 8.8 3 16c0 2.3.6 4.5 1.7 6.4L3 29l6.8-1.7c1.8 1 3.9 1.6 6.2 1.6 7.2 0 13-5.8 13-13S23.2 3 16 3zm0 23.6c-2 0-3.9-.5-5.5-1.5l-.4-.2-4 1 1.1-3.9-.3-.4c-1.1-1.7-1.6-3.7-1.6-5.6 0-5.9 4.8-10.7 10.7-10.7s10.7 4.8 10.7 10.7-4.9 10.6-10.7 10.6z\"></path></svg>WA</div><div class=\"sys-node\" title=\"Web\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path></svg>WEB</div></div><div class=\"sys-flow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"sys-core\"><span class=\"live-dot\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>ACTIVO</span><div class=\"sys-core-title\">AI ENGINE</div><div class=\"sys-core-sub\">Calificación · Scoring · Routing</div></div><div class=\"sys-flow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"sys-label\">Tu stack</div><div class=\"sys-row out\"><div class=\"sys-node\" title=\"CRM\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5\"></path></svg>CRM</div><div class=\"sys-node\" title=\"Calendario\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg>CITAS</div></div></div><div><span class=\"section-tag\">Nosotros</span><h2 class=\"section-title\">Tecnología con <span>Propósito</span></h2><p style=\"color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:1.2rem;font-size:1.05rem\">Somos un equipo de ingenieros y especialistas en ventas B2B que entendió que el problema no era la falta de leads, sino la falta de seguimiento inmediato.</p><p style=\"color:var(--text-dim);font-size:1.05rem\">Desarrollamos AI Lead Shield para eliminar la fricción entre marketing y ventas, garantizando que cada oportunidad sea atendida en menos de 1 minuto, los 365 días del año.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"cta\" class=\"cta-section\"><div class=\"container reveal\"><div class=\"cta-box\"><div class=\"badge\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><span class=\"badge-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Demo Gratis</div><h2 class=\"section-title\">¿Listo para capturar cada <span>oportunidad?</span></h2><p class=\"section-desc\" style=\"margin:1rem auto 2.5rem\">Agenda una llamada de diagnóstico de 15 minutos. Implementamos tu sistema en menos de 30 días.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem\"><a href=\"https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/l4MFnsp6eATJEWMSqGLJ\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:1.15rem 3r